# shared/build/ARTIFACTS.sha256 — canonical hashes of the six merged
# game-data artifacts. The artifacts themselves are NOT tracked (M22):
# they contain Origin-copyrighted bytes. Rebuild them from your own
# game data with tools/build_artifacts.sh, which verifies against this
# file. Regenerate it with --record only for a DELIBERATE artifact
# change; the diff here is the record of that decision.
#
# Checkable with the standard tool, from shared/build/:
#     shasum -a 256 -c ARTIFACTS.sha256
#
